     A                                      'THRU DATE')
     A                                      TEXT('AUTO-REINSTATE/CALCUTATE BILL-
     A                                      INGS THRU DATE FLAG')
     A*                                     "I"=Use Cancellation Issue Date
     A*                                     "C"=Use Current Date (process date)
     A*                                     "E"=Use Cancellation Effective Date'
     A*                                      BLANK = Assume default of "E"
      ***** END ADD ***** 09/25/06 *********************************************
